---
const year = 2026;
---
<footer class="border-t border-forest/10 bg-white/50">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-semibold text-fg">
        <img src="/logo-64.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" class="size-7" />
        <span>Explore<span class="text-gold-deep">NDMU</span></span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-mute">
        An augmented reality campus tour, navigation and information app for Notre Dame of Marbel University,
        Koronadal City. A BS Information Technology capstone project.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-gold-deep font-semibold">Explore</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-mute">
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="index.html#features">Features</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="index.html#places">Places</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="index.html#how">How it works</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="index.html#engineering">Engineering notes</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="research.html">Research</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-forest" href="index.html#download">Get the app</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-gold-deep font-semibold">Credits</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-mute leading-relaxed">
        <li>Bronze Stallion: “Horse Run Cycle On Place” by Amitesh Nandan (Sketchfab), licensed <a class="underline decoration-forest/40 hover:text-forest" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CC BY-ND 4.0</a>. Used in the app only.</li>
        <li>Icons: Flaticon UIcons.</li>
        <li>Campus photos: ExploreNDMU team.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-forest/10 py-6 text-xs text-mute md:flex-row md:justify-between">
    <p>© {year} Amoran, Herradura, Villanueva · Notre Dame of Marbel University</p>
    <p>Built with Astro, GSAP and model-viewer.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
